#: inputs_gis/gis_esri.py:8
msgid ""
"Authoritative map service from global GIS leader Esri. Provides crisp and "
"detailed World Imagery aerial satellite photos, optimized for accurate "
"terrain and facility visualization."
msgstr ""
"全球 GIS 領導廠商 Esri 提供的權威地圖服務，提供清晰詳盡的 World Imagery 航空衛星照片，並針對精確的地形與設施視覺化進行最佳化。"

