#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:33
msgid ""
"Time-based opening control (0–100%) for vents, curtains, and ball valves. "
"Connects an Open relay and a Close relay to a single percentage command."
msgstr "通風窗、簾幕與球閥的時間基礎開度控制(0–100%)。將開啟繼電器與關閉繼電器連接至單一百分比命令。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:46 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:97
msgid "Actuator Kind"
msgstr "致動器種類"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:47 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:98
msgid "Type of actuator being controlled."
msgstr "受控致動器的類型。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:55
msgid "Output: Open"
msgstr "輸出:開啟"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:56
msgid "on/off Output channel connected to the OPEN relay."
msgstr "連接至開啟繼電器的 on/off 輸出頻道。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:64
msgid "Output: Close"
msgstr "輸出:關閉"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:65
msgid "on/off Output channel connected to the CLOSE relay."
msgstr "連接至關閉繼電器的 on/off 輸出頻道。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:72 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:141
msgid "Travel Time Open (s)"
msgstr "開啟移動時間(秒)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:74 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:143
msgid ""
"Seconds to travel from fully closed (0%) to fully open (100%). If unset, the"
" close travel time is used as a fallback. Use the Calibration buttons below "
"to measure automatically."
msgstr "從完全關閉(0%)移動到完全開啟(100%)所需的秒數。若未設定,將以關閉移動時間作為替代值。可使用下方的校準按鈕自動測量。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:83 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:152
msgid "Travel Time Close (s)"
msgstr "關閉移動時間(秒)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:85 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:154
msgid ""
"Seconds to travel from fully open (100%) to fully closed (0%). If unset, the"
" open travel time is used as a fallback."
msgstr "從完全開啟(100%)移動到完全關閉(0%)所需的秒數。若未設定,將以開啟移動時間作為替代值。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:93 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:250
msgid "Open Start Position (%)"
msgstr "開啟起始位置(%)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:95
msgid ""
"Reference only (informational). Motor position (%) at which the mechanism "
"visually begins to open. The command value is used as the motor position "
"directly and is NOT rescaled by this field — a command of 22% maps directly "
"to motor position 22."
msgstr ""
"僅供參考(資訊用途)。機構在視覺上開始開啟時的馬達位置(%)。命令值會直接作為馬達位置使用,不會由此欄位重新縮放 — 22% 的命令會直接對應至馬達位置"
" 22。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:105 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:261
msgid "Full Open Position (%)"
msgstr "完全開啟位置(%)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:107
msgid ""
"Reference only (informational). Motor position (%) regarded as fully open. "
"The command value is used as the motor position directly and is NOT capped "
"by this field. A command of 0% always moves to the physical end-stop "
"(emergency fully-closed)."
msgstr ""
"僅供參考(資訊用途)。視為完全開啟的馬達位置(%)。命令值會直接作為馬達位置使用,不會受此欄位限制。0% "
"的命令一律會移動到物理極限位置(緊急完全關閉)。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:117 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:274
msgid "Min Move Step (%)"
msgstr "最小移動步階(%)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:119
msgid ""
"Motor lifespan protection for automatic environment control. The motor moves"
" only when the target differs from the last sent position by at least this "
"much, and commands snap to this grid (e.g. 5% → 0, 5, 10 …). This absorbs "
"the small per-cycle fluctuations of the PI controller so the motor is not "
"driven every cycle. Set to 0 to disable — every minor fluctuation then "
"drives the motor (legacy behavior)."
msgstr ""
"用於自動環境控制的馬達壽命保護。僅當目標值與最後傳送的位置至少相差此數值時,馬達才會移動,且命令會對齊此格距(例如 5% → "
"0、5、10……)。這能吸收 PI 控制器每個週期的細微波動,避免馬達每個週期都被驅動。設為 0 可停用此功能 — "
"屆時任何細微波動都會驅動馬達(舊有行為)。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:131 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:286
msgid "Last Position (%)"
msgstr "最後位置(%)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:133 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:288
msgid ""
"Last known position. Updated automatically on each move so the value "
"survives daemon restarts. Edit manually only if you know the actual "
"position."
msgstr "最後已知位置。每次移動時會自動更新,因此該值在守護程序重啟後仍會保留。僅在確知實際位置時才手動編輯。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:141 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:296
msgid "Last Target (%)"
msgstr "上次目標值 (%)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:143 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:298
msgid ""
"Last manually commanded target position. -1 means not set. Saved on each "
"manual set command so the target survives daemon restarts."
msgstr "最後一次手動指定的目標位置。-1 表示尚未設定。每次執行手動設定命令時都會儲存，因此即使守護程式重新啟動,目標值也會保留。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:151 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:306
msgid "Min Command Interval (s)"
msgstr "最小命令間隔 (秒)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:153
msgid ""
"Reject any new Open/Close command that arrives within this many seconds of "
"the previous one. Prevents queued-up motor whiplash from rapid button "
"presses. Stop is always accepted regardless of this interval."
msgstr ""
"若新的開啟/關閉命令在上一次命令後的此秒數內到達,將予以拒絕。可防止因快速按鍵而導致馬達命令堆積與劇烈反轉。無論此間隔為何,停止命令一律會被接受。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:162 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:227
msgid "Reverse Pause (s)"
msgstr "反向暫停時間 (秒)"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:164
msgid ""
"Dwell time inserted when reversing direction (open↔close) to protect the "
"motor. Both relays stay OFF for this many seconds before the new direction "
"starts."
msgstr "反轉方向(開啟↔關閉)時插入的停留時間,用以保護馬達。在新方向開始前,兩個繼電器將維持 OFF 狀態達此秒數。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:172 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:317
msgid "Invert Direction"
msgstr "反轉方向"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:174
msgid ""
"Swap Open and Close relays in software. Enable when 0% physically deploys "
"the actuator and 100% pulls it back (e.g. thermal curtain wired with Close ="
" deploy)."
msgstr "在軟體中交換開啟與關閉繼電器。當 0% 時致動器實際展開、100% 時收回時請啟用此選項(例如以「關閉 = 展開」方式接線的保溫簾)。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:184 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:329
msgid "Calibration Direction"
msgstr "校正方向"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:186 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:331
msgid ""
"Click Start → actuator moves → click Stop when fully open or closed → "
"elapsed time is saved to Travel Time Open or Travel Time Close."
msgstr "點擊開始 → 致動器移動 → 完全開啟或關閉時點擊停止 → 經過時間會儲存至開啟移動時間或關閉移動時間。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:194 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:340
msgid "▶ Start Calibration"
msgstr "▶ 開始校正"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:196
msgid "Drives the actuator in the selected direction. Click Stop when done."
msgstr "以所選方向驅動致動器。完成後請點擊停止。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:201 outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:348
msgid "■ Stop & Save"
msgstr "■ 停止並儲存"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:203
msgid ""
"Stops the actuator and saves elapsed time to Travel Time Open or Travel Time"
" Close."
msgstr "停止致動器,並將經過時間儲存至開啟移動時間或關閉移動時間。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:80
msgid ""
"Time-based opening control (0–100%) for a vent, curtain or valve whose Open "
"and Close relays are SHARED with other actuators, each picked by its own "
"selector relay — so a 6-channel relay board drives four windows. Add one of "
"these outputs per actuator, give them the same Open/Close channels, and they"
" schedule against each other automatically. Selector contacts are only ever "
"switched while the shared bus is de-energized. Use \"Actuator Paired\" "
"instead when the actuator has its own dedicated Open/Close relays."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:106
msgid "Output: Selector"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:108
msgid ""
"on/off Output channel that connects the shared bus to THIS actuator. It is "
"switched on before the bus starts and off after the bus stops, never under "
"load. Leave empty only if this actuator has the bus to itself."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:118
msgid "Output: Open (shared bus)"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:120
msgid ""
"on/off Output channel connected to the OPEN relay. Every actuator naming the"
" same Open and Close channels shares one bus and is scheduled against the "
"others."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:130
msgid "Output: Close (shared bus)"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:132
msgid ""
"on/off Output channel connected to the CLOSE relay. Every actuator naming "
"the same Open and Close channels shares one bus and is scheduled against the"
" others."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:162
msgid "Limit Switch Fitted"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:164
msgid ""
"Enable when this actuator has limit switches at both ends. An end-stop "
"target (0%, 100%) may then be driven longer than its calculated travel time,"
" letting several actuators reach their end stop in a single bus run — an "
"emergency close of every window finishes in one run instead of one per "
"window. Disable when there is no limit switch, or the motor would stall."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:180
msgid "Allow Parallel Driving"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:182
msgid ""
"Let this actuator move at the same time as others on the same bus, when they"
" are driving the same relay. Enable only if the bus and its supply can carry"
" all of those motors at once. Opposite directions are never run together "
"regardless of this setting. If any actuator on a bus disables this, the "
"whole bus moves one actuator at a time."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:193
msgid "Batch Window (s)"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:195
msgid ""
"Commands arriving within this window are planned together, so a control "
"cycle that targets every actuator on the bus becomes one batch instead of a "
"queue of separate moves."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:204
msgid "Selector Settle Time (s)"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:206
msgid ""
"Dwell between a selector relay changing and the shared bus being energized "
"(and again after the bus stops, before the selector is released), so the "
"contacts never switch under load."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:215
msgid "Relay Confirm Timeout (s)"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:217
msgid ""
"How long to wait for a selector or bus relay to report its new state before "
"giving up on this actuator. Wired relays confirm immediately; radio-linked "
"relays confirm when the device acknowledges. The bus is never energized "
"against an unconfirmed selector."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:229
msgid ""
"Dwell inserted when the shared bus changes direction (open↔close) to protect"
" the motors. Both bus relays stay off for this long before the new direction"
" starts."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:238
msgid "Force Relays Off At Startup"
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:240
msgid ""
"After the daemon starts, switch off any selector or bus relay still "
"reporting on — a restart during travel would otherwise leave a motor "
"running. Only relays actually reporting on are commanded, so toggle-protocol"
" outputs are not phantom-activated."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:252
msgid ""
"Reference only (informational). Motor position (%) at which the mechanism "
"visually begins to open. The command value is used as the motor position "
"directly and is NOT rescaled by this field."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:263
msgid ""
"Reference only (informational). Motor position (%) regarded as fully open. "
"The command value is NOT capped by this field. A command of 0% moves to the "
"physical end stop regardless (emergency fully-closed)."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:276
msgid ""
"Motor lifespan protection for automatic environment control. The motor moves"
" only when the target differs from the last sent position by at least this "
"much, and commands snap to this grid (e.g. 5% → 0, 5, 10 …). Set to 0 to "
"disable — every minor fluctuation then drives the motor."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:308
msgid ""
"Reject any new target arriving within this many seconds of the previous one."
" Prevents queued-up motor whiplash from rapid button presses. Stop is always"
" accepted regardless of this interval."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:319
msgid ""
"Swap the Open and Close relays in software. Enable when 0% physically "
"deploys the actuator and 100% pulls it back. An inverted actuator is never "
"driven in parallel with a non-inverted one, because they energize opposite "
"relays."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:342
msgid ""
"Engages this actuator's selector and drives it in the selected direction. "
"Refused while the shared bus is busy. Click Stop when done."
msgstr ""

#: outputs/actuator_paired_bus.py:350
msgid ""
"Stops the bus, releases the selector and saves the elapsed time to Travel "
"Time Open or Travel Time Close."
msgstr ""

